
            	<h3><u>Jalte Hue Khaime hai</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hai Dukhtare shere khuda, jo karbala mei hai berida) x2</span><br></p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font size=""4""><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><ol><li>(Ummat se milaa) x2 kaisa ye zainab ko silaa hai</li><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><li>Aale Abaa ke sar hai charhe nouke sinaa par, laashe pare hai harsu jo sab reg-e-tapaa par, (pehnaati unhe) x2 ban mei kafan khaake shafaa hai</li><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><p>Ummat se milaa, kaisa ye zainab ko silaa hai</p><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><li>Aabid ko laa rahi hai woh kaandho pe uthaa kar, aur shimr ko kehti hai zaraa khoufe khuda kar, (koi naa raha) x2 ik yehi bimaar bacha hai</li><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><p>Ummat se milaa, kaisa ye zainab ko silaa hai</p><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><li>Karte hai sab farishte shabbir ka matam, karti hai huro walma beshir ka matam, (matam shahe be) x2 kas ka sar-e-arsh bapaa hai</li><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><p>Ummat se milaa, kaisa ye zainab ko silaa hai</p><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><li>Is baat ki ai shaam-e-gharibaan hai gawaah tu, saare nahi ye saanie zehra ke hai aansu, (""Khursheed"" nahi) x2 aaj to khud rota khuda hai</li></ol><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x2</p><p>Ummat se milaa, kaisa ye zainab ko silaa hai</p><p>(Jalte huwe khaime hain, naa bhaai naa rida hai) x4</p></font></span></p>
                 